    "body": "We’re a few days into November and the deals are flying. Today’s 9to5Toys Green Deals is packed with notable finds, which are headlined by Home Depot’s early Black Friday sale . In that post we cover how you can score BOGO FREE tools, $1,250 off appliances, and more. Others markdowns include Fanttik’s USB-C rechargeable pruning shears at $80 , this 9-in-1 WORX leaf blower for only $91 , and even EcoFlow’s latest 320W RAPID Pro desktop charger at $140 . Head below for a closer look at the details.\nOh, and don’t forget to scope out Electrek ‘s best EV buying and leasing deals as well as the Electrek Tesla Shop for the best deals on Tesla accessories .\nHome Depot early Black Friday deals now live: BOGO FREE tools, DEWALT $170 off, $1,250 off appliances, more\nHome Depot is running “deals all month long,” and today we are checking in with the early Black Friday offers now live. It is already running a host of appliance Doorbusters , up to 50% off select saws , as much as $170 off DEWALT electric tools , and a FREE tool or battery offer with select purchases, plus much more.\nHome Depot early Black Friday sale\nHome Depot is running an extensive Black Friday month sale with loads of deals already live, new tool deals every Thursday, a host of new Doorbusters on November 27, and more, all before the Holiday Tree Lot opens up on Black Friday at brick and mortar stores. You’ll find a rundown of the schedule below, but, again, there are already loads of notable deals live now.\nAdvertisement - scroll for more content\nHome Depot Black Friday Tool deals\nHome Depot Black Appliance deals\nHome Depot Black Friday Bath deals\nHome Depot Black Friday Kitchen deals\nHome Depot Black Friday Furniture deals\nHome Depot Black Friday Flooring deals\nHome Depot Black Friday Storage deals\nHome Depot Black Friday Lighting deals\nUp to 45% off Select Tools\nUp to $1,250 off Select Appliances\nUp to 40% off Select Ladders\nUp to 15% off Select Doors online\nAs you can see above, the early Black Friday Home Depot sale is delivering loads of freebie add-ons . There are plenty of battery bundles from $99 you can score a FREE tool – browse through all of the options right here :\nBOGO FREE electric tool bundles\nBuy a Battery and Charger bundle score a FREE tool (worth up to $99)\nHome Depot Black Friday schedule:\nNew Tools deals every Thursday starting November 5\nHome Depot Black Friday Savings Event November 5 to 25\nFREE Kids Workshop starts November 21\nAppliance deals starts on November 26\nBlack Friday Doorbusters start on November 27\nHoliday Tree Lot opens on November 27\nCyber Monday deals begin on November 30\nIt’s more than a leaf blower: This 9-in-1 WORX tool just hit $91 at Amazon\nOver at Amazon you can find the WORX 9-in-1 Cordless Leaf Blower for $90.99 shipped . This unit tends to fetch $120 these days, and today’s offer shaves $29 off that price. This comes within $1 of Amazon’s 2026 low, making this a solid time to strike, especially since the leaves are flying right now. As the 9-in-1 name implies, this unit aims to do far more than handle leaves, and we’ll dive into that down below.\nI actually owned and used this leaf blower for a few years and really liked it. No, it’s not as powerful as some of the bigger units out there, but the price is also much easier on your wallet too. What makes this specific bundle interesting is that it includes 9 different attachments. This allows it to be used in so many ways, with loads of examples showcased in the image above. A couple of standouts for me have to be the inflator nozzle and deflation cover.\nModernize fall trimming with Fanttik’s USB-C rechargeable Y10 Pro shears at $80 (Save 20%)\nEcoFlow’s latest 320W RAPID Pro desktop charger with smart display hits $140 Amazon low\nBlack Friday delivers Monarc’s first price cuts on Marker all-terrain + Tracer commuter e-bikes from $1,299\nEcoFlow TITAN Series Whole-Home Backup Ecosystem launches with up to $2,199 savings starting from $2,374\nWorx’s 13A 2,200 PSI electric pressure washer is a budget-friendly way to clear grime at $161 (Reg. $290)\nExpand the Worx Aerocart’s 8-in-1 functionality with this Firewood Carrier attachment down at a $30 2026 low\nFTC: We use income earning auto affiliate links. More.\nStay up to date with the latest content by subscribing to Electrek on Google News . You’re reading Electrek— experts who break news about Tesla , electric vehicles, and green energy , day after day. Be sure to check out our homepage for all the latest news, and follow Electrek on X , Facebook , and LinkedIn to stay in the loop. Don’t know where to start? Check out our YouTube channel for the latest reviews.",
